Lipat ke shaha se boli ye fatema sugra s.a<br>
Watan mai kaise mai tanha rahungi aye baba<br>
<br>
<br>
1,Aye baba waqt karha kaisa aaya hai mujhpar<br>
Baghair aap ke ghuzregi kaise shaam o saher<br>
Mujhe bhi saath mai lelo chalungi karbobala<br>
Watan mai kaise ....<br>
<br>
2,Sakina bibi ki baate mujhe rulaye gii<br>
Wo sheer khaar ki yaade mujhe sataye gii<br>
Ye dono lakhte jigar ko too choudo isjaa<br>
Watan mai kaise.....<br>
<br>
3,Zameen roti hai aur asmaan rota hai<br>
Lipat ke sugra se kadyal jawaan rota hai<br>
Baghair bhai ke mumkin kaha mera jeena<br>
Watan mai kaise.....<br>
<br>
4,Mera haseen mera maharu ali akber<br>
Jawaan bhai mera ham shabhiy ebaighambar<br>
Biyaa howe to mujhko bhi yaad karlena<br>
Watan mai kaise.....<br>
<br>
5,Mareez ho mai safar saqt hai mujhe maloom<br>
Tamam kunba hai jo mere waaste maqmoom<br>
Chalungi saath too hojaengi mujhe bhi shifa<br>
Watan mai kaise......<br>
<br>
6,Hussain bole ye sugra meri khuda hafiz <br>
Hamari hoti hai ab ruqsati khuda hafiz<br>
Khayaal rakhegi dadi tera ye na kahna<br>
Watan mai kaise .....<br>
<br>
7,Pouhanch ke karbobala ham tumhe bulaengee<br>
Tu shifayaab agar hogi too ham ayengee<br>
Tum apne aap ko aise nahi kehna beta<br>
Watan mai kaise....<br>
<br>
8,Sada e fatima sughra hai aur tanhayee<br>
Hussain honge na abbas na koi bhai<br>
Sada e deti rahi jab tak thi wo zindaa<br>
Watan mai kaise ....<br>
<br>
9,Wo intezar mai yasrab mai margayee ammar<br>
Na shaha aye na akber na phir alambardar<br>
Hai aaj tak bhi fizaoo mai fatema ki sada<br>
Watan mai kaise......<br>
